  "description": "The component CATALOG of an Agent pebble (a PERSONA — the WHO of the work, a role with judgment that USES skills): each content component and WHAT belongs under it — role, instructions, boundaries, escalation, constraints — plus the skill-vs-agent distinction, what an agent references (skills + rules + knowledge), that it has no resources, and every agent-related pebbles-cli command. A DEFINITION reference skills point at.",
